    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "-\tTwo-bedroom property situated in Athboy town\r\n-\tGenerous site extending to approximately 0.215 acres\r\n-\tExcellent potential for modernisation and improvement\r\n\r\nO’Growney Street is a conveniently located two/three-bedroom property situated within Athboy town, offering easy access to a wide range of local amenities including schools, shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and sporting facilities. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation extending to approximately 83 sq. m. / 893 sq. ft., together with a generous site extending to approximately 0.215 acres.\r\nThe accommodation comprises entrance hall, corridor, two bedrooms, shower room, living room, dining room and kitchen. The property further benefits from oil-fired central heating with back boiler, PVC windows, mains water and mains sewerage.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property occupies a generous site providing excellent space for outdoor use and potential for further improvement, subject to the necessary planning permission. Athboy is a popular and well-established town with a good range of amenities close by, while Navan and Trim are within easy reach. The property also offers convenient access to the M3 motorway and surrounding commuter routes.\r\n\r\nThis property represents an excellent opportunity for a purchaser seeking a well-located home with a generous site and scope for modernisation and improvement."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\nEntrance Hall 3.32m x 1.15m\r\nCorridor 2.88m x 0.92m\r\nBedroom 1 3.69m x 3.00m\r\nBedroom 2 3.63m x 2.98m\r\nShower Room 1.87m x 2.38m\r\nLiving Room 4.08m x 3.45m\r\nDining Room 4.09m x 3.00m\r\nKitchen 3.73m x 2.56m\r\n\r\nApproximate overall floor area: 83 sq. m. / 893 sq. ft. \r\n\r\nOutside\r\nThe property occupies a generous site extending to approximately 0.215 acres. The grounds provide excellent outdoor space with potential for gardening, recreation or further improvement, subject to the necessary planning permission.\r\n\r\nServices\r\nOil-fired central heating with back boiler. Mains water. Mains sewerage.\r\n\r\nFixtures & Fittings\r\nProperty being sold as seen. Fixtures, fittings and appliances included in the sale will be detailed as applicable.\r\n\r\nBER Details\r\nBER F No. 119795359\r\n\r\nPerformance Indicator: 369.1 kWh/m²/yr.\r\n\r\nTitle\r\nFreehold."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Well-located two/three-bedroom property in Athboy town\r\n\r\nGenerous site extending to approximately 0.215 acres\r\n\r\nAccommodation extending to approximately 83 sq. m. / 893 sq. ft. as stated on BER Certificate\r\n\r\nSpacious living room and separate dining room\r\n\r\nOil-fired central heating with back boiler\r\n\r\nPVC windows, Mains water and mains sewerage\r\n\r\nClose to schools, shops and local amenities\r\n\r\nConvenient access to Navan, Trim and surrounding areas\r\n\r\nExcellent potential for modernisation and improvement\r\n\r\nBuilt c. 1945"
      },
